5,1,1,talk,May,,"Let's be honest, the break room is a bit of a disaster zone lately. It's just a free-for-all, isn't it? I think we need a real system so it doesn't just fall on one person to fix.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It's become too cluttered to be useful for anything. We should probably look into how it's actually being used and what the physical issues are before we decide.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to see us addressing this together. A space should nourish the spirit, not drain our energy. Let us look closely at how our time and efforts are spent within these walls.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I agree! It's like a big puzzle we need to solve! But we should check if we're spending too much money on other things because the room is a mess. Let's look at the numbers!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you all! It's definitely a mess, but I hope we don't just focus on the stuff. We should also think about how we actually talk to each other in there. It feels a bit lonely lately.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"Exactly! It's not just about the mess, but who's actually using it and when. If we don't have a clear rule, we're just guessing. Let's get some actual data on the usage and the cleanup.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,That makes sense. I'm particularly concerned about the noise and the mess leaking into the office area. We should investigate the partition wall and the state of the bins to see where the real problems lie.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom comes from understanding the hidden costs of our habits. I believe we must examine the invoices for outside hire and the round trip for a hot lunch to see where our precious hours vanish.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, you're right! I want to see those invoices too! And maybe we should check the quotes for the fit-outs? I want to know exactly how much it costs to make it pretty!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, making it pretty is great, but I'm worried about the ""vibe."" I want to know where the last awkward conversation happened and if we've had any unplanned talks since the refit. We need a place to really connect!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm all for the ""vibe,"" @Kenji, but vibes don't empty the bins. I want to see the fortnight's tally of use by person and the crumbs and bins at the desks. Let's see who's actually there.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I think we have a good list. To be thorough, I'll focus on the partition wall to the office and the crumbs and bins at the desks. We need to know if the room's issues are affecting our workspace.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is wise to balance the practical with the spiritual. I shall look into the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the round trip for a hot lunch to understand our time.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'll take the quotes for the two fit-outs and the invoices for outside hire! I want to see the real numbers so we don't accidentally spend all our pennies!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll stick with my plan! I'm going to look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened. Let's find out how we're actually getting along in there!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Sounds like a plan! I'll stick with the fortnight's tally of use by person and the crumbs and bins at the desks. Let's see who's actually contributing to the chaos and who's just along for the ride.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm satisfied with the distribution. I'll focus on the partition wall and the crumbs and bins. It's important to understand how the room's condition impacts those of us working right next to it.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,"May, Misaki, Sakura, Kenji—your enthusiasm is a breath of fresh air. Let us proceed with these investigations. I look forward to seeing how we can reclaim our time and peace. I am ready.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki"",""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I'm super excited to be a detective! I'll find all the secret numbers and tell you if they're scary or not. Let's go find the answers!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready too! Let's see what we find. I really hope we can make this a place where we can all be honest and close with each other. Let's do this!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
