62,3,1,talk,May,,"Looking at these options, A is the only one that actually solves the crumb problem and the lunch commute. But ""maintained by whoever uses them"" is too vague. We need a concrete, fair rotation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I agree. Option A is the most practical for the office environment, provided we fix the sound issues. If we choose A, we must ensure the noise from the kitchen doesn't disrupt our work.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the physical space is but a vessel for our well-being. Option A offers the greatest gift: the return of our time. Let us ensure the maintenance is a shared harmony, not a hidden burden.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@May, @Misaki, Option A is the cheapest too! 96,000 yen is way better than 141,000! Plus, we stop wasting 68,000 yen on outside rooms. It's the smartest way to use our pennies!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"I agree that Option A is the best! If we have a place to eat and relax together, we can finally stop being strangers. Let's just make sure it's a place where we can also talk honestly!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"I'm sold on A, but let's be crystal clear: ""maintained by whoever uses them"" is a recipe for disaster. I want a signed agreement on a cleaning schedule so the burden doesn't just fall on the most conscientious person.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with @May. A clear agreement is necessary. However, I also want to ensure that ""Open Kitchen"" doesn't mean ""noisy hub."" We must commit to keeping the volume down to protect the office's focus.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A structured agreement is a wise foundation. When we clarify our duties, we remove the seeds of resentment. Let us pledge to honor each other's time and peace as we share this new sanctuary.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"I can help with the agreement! We can make a big, bright chart with everyone's name on it! That way, we can see exactly who is helping and keep our pennies safe!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, that sounds awesome! As long as we use that space to actually get to know each other and have a place for those tough conversations, I'm all in for Option A! Let's make it a friendly place!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"Since we're all in agreement on the utility and the cost, I'm happy to vote for A. Just remember, a colorful chart is only useful if people actually follow it! Let's make this fair for everyone.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll vote for A as well. It's the most logical choice to stop the mess from spreading into the office, provided we are mindful of the noise levels and the cleaning rules.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I shall also cast my vote for Option A. By reducing our travel and reclaiming our hours, we nourish our vitality. Let us move forward with a spirit of mutual respect and shared care.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I'm voting for A too! It's the best deal for our budget, and it'll be so much fun to have a cozy spot! I'll make sure the cleaning chart is the prettiest one ever!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm voting for A too! Let's turn this room into a place where we can really connect and be friends. I can't wait for us to finally have a cozy spot to talk!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,"It's settled then. I'm voting for Option A. Let's just make sure that ""fairness"" is the priority when we set up that chart, or I'll be the first one complaining!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,"I'm voting for Option A. As long as we are disciplined about the noise and the cleaning, it's the best solution for everyone's peace of mind. Let's make it work.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,I cast my vote for Option A. May we use this reclaimed time to bring more light and kindness into our workday. I am glad we have found a path that honors both our needs and our time.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm voting for Option A! It's the best way to save our pennies and make the room super cozy! I'll get my markers ready for that cleaning chart right now! Yay!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm voting for Option A! I'm so excited that we're doing this. Let's make sure we use our new cozy kitchen to really get to know each other and be there for one another!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
